# Drizzle Kit's migration journal and snapshots.
#
# `drizzle-kit generate` writes JSON that Prettier disagrees with, so every new migration
# turned `npm run format:check` red until someone ran `prettier --write` over generated
# artefacts — which then produced a diff nobody could review and which the next `generate`
# would undo. They are tracked (never re-ignore them in git: without the journal,
# `drizzle-kit migrate` applies nothing on a fresh checkout), but they are machine output
# and Prettier has no business reformatting them.
server/database/migrations/meta/

# Committed reference data: one food per line, on purpose, so a dataset update is a
# reviewable diff rather than one rewritten mega-line.
server/database/seeds/
